    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 734,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "MY days among the Dead are past;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Around me I behold,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Where’er these casual eyes are cast,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "The mighty minds of old:",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My never-failing friends are they,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "With whom I converse day by day.",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 734,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "With them I take delight in weal",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And seek relief in woe;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And while I understand and feel",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "How much to them I owe,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My cheeks have often been bedew’d",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "With tears of thoughtful gratitude.",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 734,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "My thoughts are with the Dead; with them",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "I live in long-past years,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Their virtues love, their faults condemn,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Partake their hopes and fears,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And from their lessons seek and find",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Instruction with an humble mind.",
       "i": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "verse",
     "pg": 734,
     "lines": [
      {
       "s": "My hopes are with the Dead; anon",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "My place with them will be,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "And I with them shall travel on",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Through all Futurity;",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "Yet leaving here a name, I trust,",
       "i": 0
      },
      {
       "s": "That will not perish in the dust.",
       "i": 0
      }
